OL,3,GNEWSASkirlington Market will live on at
OL,4,Aits new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA market forced to move after 40 years
OL,7,Fhas found a new home, "a stone's throw
OL,8,Faway" from its current site.
OL,10,FSkirlington Market, in Skipsea, East
OL,11,FYorkshire, faced becoming homeless
OL,12,Fafter approval was granted in July for
OL,13,FUnity Holidays to build sports
OL,14,Ffacilities on the existing site.
OL,16,FBut Tom Parry, who runs the market,
OL,17,Fsaid the new space ` a field on the
OL,18,Froad to Bridlington ` would "evolve the
OL,19,Fmarket".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
