OL,3,GNEWSASkirlington Market will live on at
OL,4,Aits new home
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's in a nicer location," he said.
OL,7,F"It's a lovely field with beautiful
OL,8,Fviews out the back, and we can design
OL,9,Fit how we want it."
